# {{DISPLAY_NAME}} shared cart skill

This generated starter is an isolated placeholder for `{{STORE_SLUG}}`. It is
not a working store adapter. Every supported adapter command fails closed with
`not_implemented` until store-specific read and mutation behavior is written and
verified against [the adapter contract](references/adapter-contract.md).

## Non-secret configuration

- Base URL: `{{BASE_URL}}`
- Login URL: `{{LOGIN_URL}}`
- Locale: `{{LOCALE}}`

Keep account identities, credentials, cookies, tokens, browser profiles,
session state, selectors, ports, and populated preferences outside committed
files. The local `data/preferences.json` file is ignored by default.

## Generated files

- `SKILL.md` contains the store boundary and safe operating workflow.
- `store.json` contains only public, non-secret store metadata.
- `adapter.mjs` validates `status`, `cart`, `search`, and `ensure`, then returns
  `not_implemented` without side effects.
- `lib/preferences.mjs` loads, validates, looks up, and atomically saves local
  exact-product preferences.
- `references/adapter-contract.md` is the load-bearing implementation contract.

The preference helper exports `loadPreferences`, `findPreference`,
`savePreference`, `normalizeGenericName`, and `validatePreferencesRegistry`.
A returned preference is only a candidate for fresh live revalidation.

## Implementation boundary

Implement only `status`, `cart`, `search`, and idempotent `ensure`. Do not add
checkout, payment, address changes, order submission, substitutions, or an
automatic retry after an uncertain mutation. A generic grocery name never
authorizes a brand or package choice, and a saved exact product must pass a
fresh live search before reuse.

Adding an item to this vendor cart is not a purchase. Never complete a Home
Stock Tracker grocery line or record inventory merely because an item entered
the cart.

## Before promotion

Follow the repository's online grocery integration tutorial. Complete read-only
discovery first, preserve per-store browser and resource isolation, use a
private account-holder login handoff, then prove every case in the live
verification matrix before enabling cart mutation.
